  "body_html": "<p>Bring warmth and festive charm to your home with this beautiful holiday bedding set by Jeminise. Featuring a realistic 3D patchwork print of a cardinal perched on a branch within a quilted frame, this cozy quilt is decorated with traditional Christmas elements like poinsettias, holly berries, pine branches, and bells. Perfect for the winter season, it makes a thoughtful personalized gift for bird lovers and a lovely addition to any bedroom, guest room, or vacation home.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalization options include a custom text input field where you can add your name or special requests to create a truly unique quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> Crafted with a soft, breathable polyester outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for continuous comfort and warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your bedding set by choosing to add 2 or 4 matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) or select the quilt alone.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 versatile sizes to fit your needs: Throw (60x70 in), Twin (68x86 in), Full (80x90 in), Queen (90x90 in), and King (102x91 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Designed for indoor and outdoor comfort, perfect as a bed quilt, a cozy throw blanket, or even a picnic and camping mat.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple and convenient maintenance—machine wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-06</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Christmas Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
